                            region given field + x_s     deserts are placement
                                                          demand points
ν_w node RF values          D1 (14) / D7 (N.5)           where energy is wanted;
                                                          beacon/charger demand
Geometry gradient           closed form: every HOPE      gradient moves for R0/R1
∂T/∂x_w                     weight is a function of      continuous actuators
                            distances (link d_{u,v} and  (§4.2)
                            field d_{i,w} terms); chain
                            rule through d^{-α}
Two-timescale template      O1-U3                        slow geometry / fast
                                                          stack convergence frame
Oracle evaluation           Tier ≤10 stack per           certified ΔV per
                            candidate g                   candidate (§4.3)
