```
MotionEnvelope {
  envelope_id, signer, signature, expiry,
  asset_id | asset_class,
  zone (geometry), speed_cap, energy_cap_per_window,
  safety_predicates,            # machine-checkable; physical safety systems
                                # external and authoritative below this line
  allowed_reversibility: {R0} | {R0,R1},     # R2 never auto (I11.2)
  dwell_min, max_moves_per_window,
  required_calibration_status of the touched region
}
```

Gate flow mirrors Tier 10 U3: proposal → (human signature) OR (envelope match
incl. reversibility class, I11.3 margin check, calibration status) → driver
dispatch → ReversibilityLedger entry (R1/R2) → post-move CalibrationManager
trigger → realized-ΔV measurement window for the Tier 10 tracker. The gate is
the only writer to geometry state; envelopes are externally minted only.

